    Neither a number nor a null proves liveness. Consumer-group membership is the authoritative check — a group holds its assignment and keeps reporting accurate lag for minutes after its consumer stops, without being evicted.
    input_schema={"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"consumer_group": {"default": "worker-dispatcher", "title": "Consumer Group", "type": "string"}}, "title": "GetConsumerLagInput", "type": "object"}
